Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 22:30:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-metal: Polar + QJL SET_ROWS for embedded Metal (Lab D1)

Allow GGML_TYPE_Q4_POLAR in Metal SET_ROWS, add quantize_q4_polar encode
kernels, fix QJL set_rows host names, and append QJL encode into the
GGML_METAL_EMBED_LIBRARY source so Darwin embed builds get both codecs.
